                "description": "The Modern Crystal Disc Knob with Disk Rose is a wonderful way to update historic homes and bring them into the modern age. The blending of the traditional crystal knob with a modern rosette and finishes makes for a stunning knobset that is sure to become a favorite. The Clear Crystal Disc Knob with matching Disk Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  \r\n",
